1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,838
Context loaded. Wiring checked?

2
00:00:01,918 --> 00:00:03,840
Spring's JUnit support loads

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,120
our configuration before the test.

4
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,320
It creates a repository

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,014
and supplies it to our service.

6
00:00:10,094 --> 00:00:11,700
Retrieve the required service bean

7
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,927
from the context.

8
00:00:13,007 --> 00:00:14,280
Compare its repository

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,820
with the context's repository.

10
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,660
Assert they're the same object.

11
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,532
Matching values aren't enough.

12
00:00:20,612 --> 00:00:21,980
Run the smoke test.

13
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,700
It passes: context loaded,

14
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:25,520
required bean found,

15
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,449
expected dependency confirmed.

16
00:00:27,529 --> 00:00:28,360
This checks wiring

17
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,460
for our configuration.

18
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:32,260
Test order behavior separately.

19
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,645
Load, look up, assert.

20
00:00:35,645 --> 00:00:36,736
Thanks for watching.

